{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n  <body>\n    <p>由獨立遊戲開發公司 Furniture &amp; Mattress 推出的角色扮演解謎遊戲《Arranger: A Role-Puzzling Adventure》，今天在 Epic Games 平台開啟限時免費活動，即日起至 5 月 14 日 23:00 前領取即可永久收藏。</p>\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/arranger1-768x1024.webp\" alt=\"arranger1\">\n    <p>本作描述一位無法適應小鎮生活的女孩潔瑪，為了探尋自我而踏出舒適圈，走進一個被「靜滯」力量宰制的世界。遊戲核心建立在獨特的「網格移動」機制上，當潔瑪在畫面上移動時，所在的行或列也會跟著滑動，玩家必須利用這種像魔方般的邏輯來解開環境謎題、戰鬥並探索世界。</p>\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/arranger3-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"arranger3\">\n    <p>遊戲美術由《時空幻境 Braid》的藝術總監操刀，風格色彩鮮明且富有人文質感。整體節奏輕鬆幽默，不需管理繁瑣的物品欄或經驗值，讓玩家能專注於充滿巧思的關卡設計與動人的故事劇情，是一部結合創意與情感的獨立遊戲佳作。</p>\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/ss_75133e3e50e3319a61613bf513a6b1054267a353.1920x1080-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"ss 75133e3e50e3319a61613bf513a6b1054267a353.1920x1080\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/ss_8a9285edf8563a03523376624e1fefd5788e6bed.1920x1080-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"ss 8a9285edf8563a03523376624e1fefd5788e6bed.1920x1080\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/ss_3f6d7b38eec7422849ffd30f78df0f31044af003.1920x1080-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"ss 3f6d7b38eec7422849ffd30f78df0f31044af003.1920x1080\">\n    <ul>\n      <li>遊戲名稱：Arranger: A Role-Puzzling Adventure</li>\n      <li>支援平台：Windows /MacOS</li>\n      <li>領取位置：Epic Games</li>\n    </ul>\n  </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-07T22:09:58.187006+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":446,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}